{
  "html": "\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 14px; background-color: #f7f1e3; color: #28221b; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; overflow-wrap: anywhere\" data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"border: 2px solid #2e261f; padding: 3px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"border: 1px solid #2e261f; padding: 16px 16px 22px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #2e261f; padding-bottom: 8px; margin: 0 0 14px; text-align: center\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 5px; color: #8c2d23; font-weight: 700\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e宋 刻 善 本\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #c9bc9f\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #362d24; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 2.0; margin: 0\"\u003e取法宋刻善本四周双边与书口墨栏，在现代手机屏幕里复现翻阅线装古籍的庄重清雅。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; border-top: 1px solid #2e261f; border-bottom: 1px solid #2e261f; padding: 8px 6px; display: table; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: table-cell; width: 24px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 12px; color: #8c2d23; font-weight: 700\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e卷\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: table-cell; width: 28px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #8c2d23\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e壹\u003c/span\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; font-size: 18.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #1f1914\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e四周双边里的古籍气度\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #28221b; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 2.0; margin: 0 0 15px\"\u003e暖黄古籍纸底配外粗内细双墨框与朱红「卷壹」通栏书眉，首屏纯文字诵读，朗朗书气扑面而来。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 12px 14px; border-left: 2px solid #8c2d23; border-right: 2px solid #8c2d23; background-color: #f0e8d4\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"border: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #4a261e; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0\"\u003e版刻有序，字句方能穿越百年而神采不减。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; border-top: 1px solid #2e261f; border-bottom: 1px solid #2e261f; padding: 8px 6px; display: table; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: table-cell; width: 24px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 12px; color: #8c2d23; font-weight: 700\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e卷\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display: table-cell; width: 28px; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #8c2d23\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e贰\u003c/span\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; font-size: 18.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #1f1914\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e古典书页的结构巧思\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #28221b; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 2.0; margin: 0 0 15px\"\u003e左右双朱线批校引语搭配宽松行距字距，极适合古典诗词、历史掌故、国学讲义与书院导读。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 6px; border: 1px solid #3a3026; background-color: #fbf7ed\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/ink-mountains.jpg\" alt=\"远山淡影与宋画意境山水\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 24px 0 0; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #2e261f; text-align: center\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #5c4f41; font-family: Georgia, \u0026#39;Songti SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;STSong\u0026#39;, SimSun, serif; font-size: 13.5px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0; text-align: center\"\u003e展卷有益，合卷生香，与诸君共赏古典之韵。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cspan data-cw-decor=\"1\" style=\"display: block; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 5px; color: #8c2d23\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e— 终 卷 —\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
